      "module": "Mathlib.Logic.Function.Conjugate",
      "line": 46,
      "statement": "theorem comp_right (h : Semiconj f ga gb) (h' : Semiconj f ga' gb') :\r\n    Semiconj f (ga ∘ ga') (gb ∘ gb')",
      "doc_comment": "If `f` semiconjugates `ga` to `gb` and `ga'` to `gb'`,\nthen it semiconjugates `ga ∘ ga'` to `gb ∘ gb'`.",
