      "kind": "def",
      "module": "Mathlib.Logic.Function.Conjugate",
      "line": 102,
      "statement": "def Commute (f g : α → α) : Prop",
      "doc_comment": "Two maps `f g : α → α` commute if `f (g x) = g (f x)` for all `x : α`.\nGiven `h : Function.commute f g` and `a : α`, we have `h a : f (g a) = g (f a)` and\n`h.comp_eq : f ∘ g = g ∘ f`.",
